@startuml
title Helpdesk Agent creates a problem ticket from similar incidents (TM Forum Open APIs / ODA)

actor "Helpdesk Agent" as Agent

box "Engagement Management"
participant "Customer Care Portal\n(Not an ODA component)" as Portal
end box

box "Core Systems"
participant "Party Interaction\n(TMFC023)" as PartyInteraction
participant "Party Problem Management\n(TMFC047)" as PartyProblemMgmt
end box

== Step 1: Helpdesk Agent gets prompt related to similar incidents reported by customer ==
Agent -> Portal : 1. Logs in
activate Portal
Portal -> PartyInteraction : 2. POST /partyInteraction (channel=Portal)
PartyInteraction --> Portal : 3. 201 Created (interaction.id)
Portal -> PartyInteraction : 4. POST /process (Agent login)
PartyInteraction --> Portal : 5. 201 Created (process.id, state=started)
Portal --> Agent : 6. Prompts regarding similar incidents reported by customers in the given region with an option to View or Dismiss
Agent -> Portal : 7. Helpdesk Agent selects View
Portal --> Agent : 8. Displays the reported trouble ticket with option to View All or Dismiss

== Step 2: Helpdesk Agent proceed ahead with creation of problem ticket ==
Agent -> Portal : 9. Selects Viewall option
Portal -> PartyInteraction : 10. PATCH /partyInteraction (adds the interaction for creation of problem ticket)
PartyInteraction --> Portal : 11. 200 OK
Portal -> PartyProblemMgmt : 12. GET /partyProblem?fields=...&{filtering type="Incident", region="..."}
PartyProblemMgmt --> Portal : 13. 200 Success
Portal --> Agent : 14. Displays the incident tickets of similar nature.
Portal -> PartyInteraction : 15. PATCH /process\n(state=Display incident ticket, category=problem)
PartyInteraction --> Portal : 16. 200 OK

== Step 3: Creation of problem ticket by Helpdesk Agent ==
Agent -> Portal : 17. Selects Proceed for creation of problem ticket
Portal --> Agent : 18. Displays screen for reporting problem
Agent -> Portal : 19. Enter the problem ticket details\n(Type, Severity, Product/Service, Description)
Portal -> PartyProblemMgmt : 20. POST /partyProblem (ticket details)
PartyProblemMgmt --> Portal : 21. 201 Created (id=PR-123456ABC, status=Open, assignedTo="Technical Team")
Portal -> PartyInteraction : 22. PATCH /process (state=Agent_Handling)
PartyInteraction --> Portal : 23. 200 OK
Portal --> Agent : 24. Notify success: Ticket PR-123456ABC created & assigned to the right Technical team.\nDisplay options to Link Tickets or Finish.

opt Helpdesk Agent selects Link Tickets
    Portal -> PartyProblemMgmt : 25. GET /partyProblem/PR-123456ABC/relatedTickets (Fetch potential target link tickets)
    PartyProblemMgmt --> Portal : 26. 200 OK (List of candidate tickets)
    Portal --> Agent : 27. Displays the candidate ticket list to be linked
    Agent -> Portal : 28. Selects target incident ticket and confirms link
    Portal -> PartyProblemMgmt : 29. PATCH /partyProblem/PR-123456ABC (Update operational relationships)
    PartyProblemMgmt --> Portal : 30. 200 OK (Relationship linked successfully)
    Portal --> Agent : 31. Displays success message of problem ticket association
end

Portal --> Agent : 32. Returns to Dashboard / Interaction complete
deactivate Portal

@enduml
